# Dewy's prelude: `named`, loaded when called (`$named[...]` calls it).

# `$named[Png Jpeg Gif]` (decisions.md, batch 7) is the record `[Png = Png Jpeg = Jpeg Gif = Gif]`:
# one member per type, named by the type's short name and holding the type. An ordinary
# compile-time function: a call is specialized on the sequence of types it is given, and a
# sequence known only at run time is rejected.
named = <Each>(types:array<Each>) =>
    [loop t in types $field(t.name) = t]
